    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Images (*.jpg) were recorded using 20 Wingscapes Timelapse Pro cameras at 30 minute intervals, 9 am to 4:30 pm, 2019-06-21 to 2019-09-25, unless otherwise noted. Cameras were positioned in each of 5 warming chambers. The cameras were mounted inside warming chambers positioned approximately 1.2 m above the ground surface in chambers or on masts positioned 1.5 m above the ground surface for ambient plots, with a view angle of 30\u201360\u00b0 from horizontal. Timestamps are Alaska Daylight Time (AKDT, UTC-8). Images captured before and after field placement were removed from the data set. Documentation of the performance of each camera is detailed in the included metadata document. Each field of view includes a black and white painted color correction stick. The chambers and matching ambient plots are labeled 1 - 5, corresponding with gas exchange locations 21 - 25 (i.e. the third year of deployment of 5 chambers). Two cameras were deployed in each chamber and matching ambient plot, designated as A and B."
    ],
